## 1. Scope and definitions

"Licensed Materials" means the AutoYou Server source, documentation, scripts,
assets, and object-code builds distributed under this License, including
modifications. Separately licensed components and independent works are
excluded to the extent described in section 5.

For original AutoYou materials included in this distribution, OpenStorey also
offers this version as an alternative to earlier AutoYou license versions
identified in file metadata. This does not relicense third-party materials or
change the terms of copies previously distributed under another version.

"Individual Use" means use by a natural person, under that person's own
control, for their own activities and productivity on equipment they own or
are authorized to use. An activity does not cease to be Individual Use solely
because it is performed in a professional setting or produces income. It
includes incidental assistance to another person, without charge or for total
compensation no greater than the applicable local statutory minimum hourly
wage for the time spent providing that assistance. This limit defines a
license permission; it does not determine employment status or alter wage
law. Where no such minimum applies, the exception covers assistance without
charge. Individual Use excludes Institutional Use and Commercial Exploitation.

"Institutional Use" means deployment, provision, or administration of the
Licensed Materials by or on behalf of a legal entity, institution, or organized
operation for use by its personnel, customers, members, or other beneficiaries,
or as part of its organized delivery of services. A natural person's
independently controlled use does not become Institutional Use merely because
an organization benefits from that person's work.

"Commercial Exploitation" means selling, renting, sublicensing for a fee,
commercially distributing, or supplying paid access to the Licensed Materials
or a product or service incorporating them; operating them as a hosted or
managed service for others; or charging for their deployment or bundled
support. Incidental assistance expressly permitted above is excluded. Income
from independent works is governed by section 5.

"Official Build" means a release expressly designated and distributed by
OpenStorey or its authorized release operator as an official AutoYou release.
A source build, fork, or modified package does not become official by using
the same version number or retaining copyright notices.

